{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Cat Book Club</strong> is an incremental idle game you can keep anywhere on your desktop.<br>While you work or relax, your cat companion will read books, cast spells, brew potions and climb ever higher shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/b2a1541dd3d1301376e096d5a8a05a58.poster.avif?t=1769683079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/b2a1541dd3d1301376e096d5a8a05a58.webm?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/b2a1541dd3d1301376e096d5a8a05a58.mp4?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAGICAL STUDIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each book will improve the cat's Memory, Comprehension, Reading speed, and all the stats needed to explore deeper into the mystical collection and eventually learn magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/71ecd3e2e2c6f6fe11779605b8cd58e4.poster.avif?t=1769683079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/71ecd3e2e2c6f6fe11779605b8cd58e4.webm?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/71ecd3e2e2c6f6fe11779605b8cd58e4.mp4?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE IT YOURS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from various fur patterns, eye colors and accessories for your cat and make every nook of the tower the coziest reading spot by unlocking magical artifacts, decorations and plants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/1240e6b6e8913d1bf7ef04eb82af1453.poster.avif?t=1769683079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/1240e6b6e8913d1bf7ef04eb82af1453.webm?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/1240e6b6e8913d1bf7ef04eb82af1453.mp4?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>DESKTOP COMPANION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The black cat will keep you company while you relax, work or study. You can move and resize the library, zoom in to take a closer look, and be as active or chill as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972410?t=1769683079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972410?t=1769683079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/b3b39e0e20b85f021bd91223cb9fcaae5b2cbbf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769683079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/b3b39e0e20b85f021bd91223cb9fcaae5b2cbbf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769683079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Cat Book Club</strong> is an incremental idle game you can keep anywhere on your desktop.<br>While you work or relax, your cat companion will read books, cast spells, brew potions and climb ever higher shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/b2a1541dd3d1301376e096d5a8a05a58.poster.avif?t=1769683079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/b2a1541dd3d1301376e096d5a8a05a58.webm?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/b2a1541dd3d1301376e096d5a8a05a58.mp4?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAGICAL STUDIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each book will improve the cat's Memory, Comprehension, Reading speed, and all the stats needed to explore deeper into the mystical collection and eventually learn magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/71ecd3e2e2c6f6fe11779605b8cd58e4.poster.avif?t=1769683079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/71ecd3e2e2c6f6fe11779605b8cd58e4.webm?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972410/extras/71ecd3e2e2c6f6fe11779605b8cd58e4.mp4?t=1769683079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE IT YOURS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from various fur patterns, eye colors and accessories for your cat and make every nook of the tower the coziest reading spot by unlocking magical artifacts, decorations and plants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse